[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:37. Making a Bookcase]
[00:01.260]Lesson 37 | 第37课
[00:03.100]You're working hard, George. | 乔治，你工作很努力。
[00:06.135]What are you doing? | 你在做什么？
[00:07.835]I'm making a bookcase. | 我在做书柜。
[00:10.785]Give me that hammer, please, Fred. | 弗雷德，请把那个锤子给我。
[00:13.935]Which hammer? | 哪个锤子？
[00:15.645]This one? | 这个吗？
[00:17.295]No, not that one. | 不，不是那个。
[00:19.530]The big one. | 那个大的。
[00:21.275]Here you are. | 给你。
[00:23.205]Thanks, Fred. | 谢谢，弗雷德。
[00:25.315]What are you going to do now, George? | 乔治，你现在要做什么？
[00:29.150]I'm going to paint it. | 我要给它上漆。
[00:31.825]What color are you going to paint it? | 你打算把它漆成什么颜色？
[00:35.380]I'm going to paint it pink. | 我要把它漆成粉红色。
[00:37.780]Pink! | 粉红色！
[00:39.060]This bookcase isn't for me. | 这个书柜不是给我的。
[00:41.560]It's for my daughter, Susan. | 是给我女儿苏珊的。
[00:43.975]Pink's her favorite color. | 粉红色是她最喜欢的颜色。